有自来矣〖6〗！若其有阙〖7〗，庸可弃乎〖8〗？宜遣间谍，以观其势。”","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":128,"end":193},{"id":"santizhu-q-c603ff0f3115a916dd10","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-827c97fc82e30ff0481c","layer":"original","quote":"綝遣使以诏书告喻钦、咨等，使取据","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":74,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":138,"end":154},{"id":"santizhu064-q-7216ea41b317f50b4a1f","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-9e8341426d9ac906dc50","layer":"original","quote":"其明年，文钦说峻征魏。峻使钦与吕据、车骑刘纂、镇南朱异、前将军唐咨，自江都入淮、泗〖13〗，以图青、徐。峻与胤至石头〖14〗，因饯之","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":393,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":66},{"id":"santizhu064-q-d291c494e8c9a9a2091f","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-da2900eb25692ecb6e49","layer":"original","quote":"据引兵还，使人报胤，欲共废綝。綝闻之，遣从兄（虑）〔宪〕，将兵逆据于江都〖3〗；使中使敕文钦、刘纂、唐咨等，合众击据；遣侍中、左将军华融、中书丞丁晏，告胤取据，并喻胤宜速去意〖4〗。胤自以祸及，因留融、晏，勒兵自卫","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":416,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":47,"end":154},{"id":"zhulv-q-a10a3c3eee3aa2496b9c","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-321b841bc136cd345e37","layer":"original","quote":"綝闻之，使中书奉诏〖9〗，诏文钦、刘纂、唐咨等，使取据；又遣从兄（虑）〔宪〕，以都下兵逆据于江都","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":90}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
